4,1,,status,George,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,George,,"Hello everyone. I think it's time we sorted this out calmly. To start, I'd like to look into what two other car-sharing households said and the hours of use recorded in the diary.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I agree we need a calm approach. I would like to look into the hours of use recorded in the diary and the month's trial of recording every run.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I think it's important to understand the actual condition of the vehicle. I'll look into the state of the car at handover and the mechanic's remarks at the last service.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I want to understand the actual costs involved. I'll look into last year's tax, insurance and parking papers, as well as last year's fuel receipts.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minato,,"I want to know how we've been paying for things. I'll look into last year's fuel receipts and the spell of checking each other's figures, please.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,George,,It seems we have a good spread of information being gathered. I'm interested to see if the experiences of other households can help us avoid the common pitfalls of these arrangements.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,Indeed. I believe focusing on the actual time spent and the frequency of runs will reveal the hidden costs of our current system. It is better to have hard data before we decide.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"I agree that data is useful, but numbers don't always reflect the daily reality of using the car. I'm hoping the mechanic's notes will reveal if the vehicle's condition is being neglected.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"Numbers are the only way to ensure fairness. If we want to avoid one person subsidizing another, we need to see exactly where the money has gone.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minato,,I agree with Misaki. I just want us all to be honest and clear about the money so nobody feels sad or treated unfairly. I think that would make everyone feel much better.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,George,,"I agree that fairness is key, but let's not forget the human element. While the figures are important, the way we interact while sharing this resource is just as vital for our long-term harmony.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"Harmony is a fine goal, George, but it is often the result of a system that works efficiently. If the process is cumbersome, friction is inevitable regardless of our intentions.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"Efficiency is important, Toshio, but a system that works on paper can still fail in practice. If the car isn't ready when needed, the most efficient payment plan won't solve the frustration.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"Regardless of the system's efficiency or the car's condition, the financial burden must be balanced. If we ignore the actual costs, we are just guessing who is paying for whom.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minato,,"I think everyone is saying something important. I just hope that by looking at the papers, we can find a way to be fair and keep everyone smiling.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,George,,I believe we have covered the main points for now. Let us proceed with looking into these items and see what the findings reveal. I look forward to hearing your thoughts in the next round.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I agree. Let us gather the facts first. I will wait to see how the data aligns with our current experiences before suggesting a path forward.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Victoria,,"I agree. Let's see what the records show. I hope we can find a solution that addresses both the financial side and the practical, daily experience of using the car.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I agree. Let's see the results. I hope the financial records provide the clarity we need to establish a truly equitable split.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minato,,"I agree too. I'm a little nervous, but I'm excited to learn how it all works. I hope we can all be happy with what we find!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
